WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:03.968
♪♪

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.400
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.868
In a speech last week at the
Volvo truck plant in Maryland,

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:11.167
President Biden said, quote,
"Let me start off

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.968
with two words --
Made in America."

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:15.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:19.100
And then it only got worse when
he said, "Sorry, I meant four."

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:20.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.133
President Biden announced
last week that he will pardon

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:25.367
thousands of individuals
convicted

00:00:25.367 --> 00:00:27.534
of simple marijuana possession
and said, quote,

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:31.000
"No one should be in jail just
for using or possessing

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.400
marijuana," because after all,
if you smoke enough marijuana,

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.000
your couch is the jail.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:42.567
Russian President Vladimir Putin
convened a meeting today

00:00:42.567 --> 00:00:44.267
of his national
security council.

00:00:44.267 --> 00:00:45.667
There were no survivors.

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:48.667
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.334
Treasury Secretary
Janet Yellen

00:00:50.334 --> 00:00:52.968
said in an interview yesterday
that OPEC's decision

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:56.200
to reduce oil output will harm
the global economy.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.901
It's what OPEC is calling
"the point."

00:00:58.901 --> 00:01:01.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:04.334
At his rally in Nevada over the
weekend, former president Trump

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:07.000
claimed that, quote, "Two years
ago, everything was so good

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.234
in our country, and now
it's going to pieces."

00:01:09.234 --> 00:01:11.801
Man, I can hardly remember.

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:14.167
I mean, what was happening
2 years ago?

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:15.501
Oh, yeah.

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:16.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:19.801
Yeah, those were --
those were good times.

00:01:19.801 --> 00:01:21.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:24.300
A federal judge in New York
last week issued a ruling

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.501
that blocked several parts
of a new state law

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:30.968
that banned guns in sensitive
areas like museums, stadiums,

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:34.033
and Times Square, because
everyone knows the only way

00:01:34.033 --> 00:01:37.133
to stop a bad guy with a gun
is a drunk Elmo

00:01:37.133 --> 00:01:39.100
with nothing to lose.

00:01:39.100 --> 00:01:41.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.267
The NFL announced over
the weekend that it will update

00:01:44.267 --> 00:01:47.634
its concussion protocol,
and then in a troubling sign,

00:01:47.634 --> 00:01:49.334
they announced it again.

00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:52.167
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.033 --> 00:01:57.901
According to a new survey,
26% of Americans believe

00:01:57.901 --> 00:02:00.901
there should be a minimum age
requirement for getting

00:02:00.901 --> 00:02:04.100
ears pierced, while over
in Jersey, there's a Claire's

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.434
in the maternity ward.

00:02:05.434 --> 00:02:08.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:16.934
That was my favorite one,
I got to acknowledge.

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:20.467
Today was former NFL quarterback
Brett Favre's 53rd birthday,

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:24.234
and even his cake was stolen
from needy children.

00:02:24.234 --> 00:02:27.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.234 --> 00:02:29.567
Oh, did we ruin his birthday?

00:02:29.567 --> 00:02:33.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.167 --> 00:02:35.567
And finally, after a video
gained attention online

00:02:35.567 --> 00:02:38.400
of a woman in a bikini getting
out of a city fire truck

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.067
in front of a strip club,
the mayor of San Jose

00:02:41.067 --> 00:02:44.234
announced last week than an
investigation has been launched.

00:02:44.234 --> 00:02:46.434
And the only way they're getting
away with this

00:02:46.434 --> 00:02:48.868
is if that woman was stuck
in a tree.

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:51.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.968 --> 00:02:54.300
Shot that in Central Park today.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:55.300
She was great.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:56.534
♪♪

00:02:56.534 --> 00:02:58.300
-White House officials are
reportedly planning

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:02.400
to downplay President Biden's
upcoming 80th birthday.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:05.467
Well, good luck with that,
because everything about Biden

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:07.467
screams "birthday week."

00:03:07.467 --> 00:03:08.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.901 --> 00:03:11.033
[As Biden] Monday, I'm going
bowling with my college buds,

00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:14.033
Tuesday's shots,
Wednesday's Dave &amp; Busters,

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:16.000
then we're all flying to Ibiza.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.801 --> 00:03:19.501
[Normally] President Biden's
granddaughter, Naomi,

00:03:19.501 --> 00:03:21.501
is set to get married
next month at the White House.

00:03:21.501 --> 00:03:24.734
Though if you're trying to make
people forget how old you are,

00:03:24.734 --> 00:03:27.300
maybe don't advertise
that your granddaughter

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:28.534
is getting married.

00:03:28.534 --> 00:03:30.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.267 --> 00:03:33.334
According to a newly-obtained
audio, House Minority Leader

00:03:33.334 --> 00:03:36.367
Kevin McCarthy told two police
officers in a private meeting

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:39.968
that former president Trump
didn't know that his supporters

00:03:39.968 --> 00:03:42.367
were attacking the Capitol
on January 6th,

00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:45.601
and the only possible way I
believe that

00:03:45.601 --> 00:03:49.534
is if he didn't know
this was the Capitol.

00:03:49.534 --> 00:03:52.567
[As Trump] I thought it was
a Medieval Times.

00:03:52.567 --> 00:03:54.400
I thought it was
a Medieval Times.

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:55.667 --> 00:03:58.033
[Normally]
Election Day is four weeks away.

00:03:58.033 --> 00:04:00.634
Said Biden, "Uh, well, then
we're also giving everyone

00:04:00.634 --> 00:04:02.334
in jail for weed 40 bucks."

00:04:02.334 --> 00:04:04.267
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.267 --> 00:04:06.801
Elon Musk discussed
his estranged daughter

00:04:06.801 --> 00:04:08.434
in a new interview and added,
quote,

00:04:08.434 --> 00:04:11.400
"I have very good relationships
with all of the others.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:12.834
Can't win them all."

00:04:12.834 --> 00:04:15.834
Hell, some people can't even
count 'em all.

00:04:15.834 --> 00:04:19.534
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.534 --> 00:04:21.868
The Northeastern University
School of Law

00:04:21.868 --> 00:04:24.167
mistakenly sent acceptance
e-mails recently

00:04:24.167 --> 00:04:25.834
to nearly 4,000 applicants.

00:04:25.834 --> 00:04:28.701
Even worse, Harvard Law
accidentally sent

00:04:28.701 --> 00:04:32.734
an acceptance e-mail to someone
whose dad didn't even go there.

00:04:32.734 --> 00:04:36.033
[ Laughter ]

00:04:36.033 --> 00:04:38.801
And finally, according to a new
ranking of fast food chains,

00:04:38.801 --> 00:04:41.934
Chick-fil-A has the slowest
average drive thru experience,

00:04:41.934 --> 00:04:44.133
while the fastest
drive thru experience

00:04:44.133 --> 00:04:46.901
is McDonald's when
all you order is ice cream.

00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:48.901
"Yeah.
One ice cream cone, please."

00:04:48.901 --> 00:04:51.234
"Sorry it's broken."
"Bye."

00:04:51.234 --> 00:04:53.033
♪♪

00:04:53.033 --> 00:04:56.400
-President Biden was interviewed
last night by CNN anchor

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:01.901
Jake Tapper, and not as he was
expecting, Walter Cronkite.

00:05:01.901 --> 00:05:05.033
[As Biden] Oh, you must be
the new kid, huh?

00:05:05.033 --> 00:05:06.601
[Normally] President Biden said
in a new interview

00:05:06.601 --> 00:05:08.167
that he doesn't think
that Russian President

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:10.868
Vladimir Putin will actually use
nuclear weapons,

00:05:10.868 --> 00:05:12.467
though I don't think
it was a good idea

00:05:12.467 --> 00:05:15.300
to add
[imitates chicken clucking].

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:16.968
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.968 --> 00:05:19.100
In the same interview,
President Biden said

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:22.067
he doesn't expect the US economy
to enter a recession,

00:05:22.067 --> 00:05:24.234
but added that if there is one,
it will be, quote,

00:05:24.234 --> 00:05:25.701
"very slight."

00:05:25.701 --> 00:05:31.400
You can watch the entire clip
in a GOP campaign ad in 2024.

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:33.167
Buckingham Palace
announced yesterday

00:05:33.167 --> 00:05:36.601
that King Charles' coronation
will take place next year

00:05:36.601 --> 00:05:38.300
and said that the event
will be, quote,

00:05:38.300 --> 00:05:41.367
"Rooted in long-standing
traditions and pageantry."

00:05:41.367 --> 00:05:43.367
You know, the things
that drove his son

00:05:43.367 --> 00:05:47.434
and daughter-in-law completely
out of the country.

00:05:47.434 --> 00:05:50.968
The Senate recently held its
12th annual bipartisan luncheon,

00:05:50.968 --> 00:05:53.968
which featured more
than 560 pounds of barbecue

00:05:53.968 --> 00:05:58.734
and I'm guessing
at least ten paramedics.

00:05:58.734 --> 00:06:00.934
According to the latest numbers,
The Netflix series

00:06:00.934 --> 00:06:03.534
"Monster: The Jeffrey Dahmer
Story" has been viewed

00:06:03.534 --> 00:06:06.667
more than 700,000,000 hours
since its release.

00:06:06.667 --> 00:06:10.734
So get ready for NBC's
newest series, "Chicago Dahmer."

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:13.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:13.501 --> 00:06:15.567
That's right. The
Jeffrey Dahmer Netflix series

00:06:15.567 --> 00:06:17.601
has been viewed more than
700,000,000 hours,

00:06:17.601 --> 00:06:20.000
I guess because it was slightly
less horrifying

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:23.133
than "The Great British
Baking Show's" Mexican Week.

00:06:23.133 --> 00:06:25.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:25.501 --> 00:06:29.167
"It's too much for me.
So we go back to 'Dahmer?'"

00:06:29.167 --> 00:06:31.334
And finally, a winner was
declared yesterday

00:06:31.334 --> 00:06:34.200
for the annual Fat Bear Week
contest.

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.067
Said the winner, "Wait, I
thought it was just bear week."

00:06:38.067 --> 00:06:39.167
[ Laughter ]

00:06:39.167 --> 00:06:40.567
♪♪

00:06:40.567 --> 00:06:43.734
The House January 6th Committee
voted unanimously today

00:06:43.734 --> 00:06:45.567
to subpoena former
President Trump.

00:06:45.567 --> 00:06:47.801
I would say this is big news,

00:06:47.801 --> 00:06:50.534
but it's really more like
putting one more parking ticket

00:06:50.534 --> 00:06:53.834
on that van that's been
on your block for a year.

00:06:53.834 --> 00:06:57.167
That ticket ain't getting paid.

00:06:57.167 --> 00:06:59.300
According to a new report,
when former president Trump

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.300
received a subpoena
earlier this year

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:04.100
for any classified documents
taken from the White House,

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:07.567
he told an employee to move
boxes to his personal residence.

00:07:07.567 --> 00:07:10.234
Man, he is a bad criminal.

00:07:10.234 --> 00:07:12.334
You're supposed to get rid
of the evidence.

00:07:12.334 --> 00:07:14.267
Trump is the first criminal

00:07:14.267 --> 00:07:16.634
to plant the evidence
on himself.

00:07:16.634 --> 00:07:17.934
[ Laughter ]

00:07:17.934 --> 00:07:22.567
"This weed? No, I'm not holding
this for a friend.

00:07:22.567 --> 00:07:25.968
I bought this with my money."

00:07:25.968 --> 00:07:29.000
A jury in Connecticut yesterday
ordered conspiracy theorist

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.000
Alex Jones to pay
nearly $1 billion

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.267
to the families affected
by the Sandy Hook shooting.

00:07:34.267 --> 00:07:37.033
So I hope he got paid
really well for his work

00:07:37.033 --> 00:07:38.801
as the Mucinex guy.

00:07:38.801 --> 00:07:41.834
[ Laughter ]

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.634
The FDA announced yesterday
that it has authorized

00:07:45.634 --> 00:07:48.501
the Omicron-targeted coronavirus
vaccine booster shots

00:07:48.501 --> 00:07:51.267
for children as young
as five years old,

00:07:51.267 --> 00:07:54.234
which is great news if you're
a parent of young children

00:07:54.234 --> 00:07:56.267
or think that you might be.

00:07:56.267 --> 00:07:59.667
[ Laughter ]

00:07:59.667 --> 00:08:03.000
Producers for LeBron James's
talk show, "The Shop,"

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.334
announced yesterday
that they will not air

00:08:05.334 --> 00:08:07.067
an upcoming episode
with Kanye West

00:08:07.067 --> 00:08:08.968
due to his use of hate speech.

00:08:08.968 --> 00:08:10.667
Because once they
edited it all out,

00:08:10.667 --> 00:08:13.367
this is what
they were left with.

00:08:13.367 --> 00:08:16.534
-So...

00:08:16.534 --> 00:08:17.601
And...

00:08:18.634 --> 00:08:20.501
-That wasn't that bad.

00:08:20.501 --> 00:08:23.100
That wasn't that offensive.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.434
A few edits
and that was just,

00:08:24.434 --> 00:08:27.601
I think, what all of us
were thinking.

00:08:27.601 --> 00:08:30.200
A man in Idaho recently broke
a Guinness World Record

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:33.400
for longest duration
balancing a guitar on his chin.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.200
Even more amazing,
he managed to keep it on there

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:39.167
the entire time he was
being kicked out of the party.

00:08:39.167 --> 00:08:42.200
[ Laughter ]

00:08:46.934 --> 00:08:50.968
Meta -- Meta this week launched
its most advanced

00:08:50.968 --> 00:08:54.300
virtual reality headset ever,
which costs $1,500.

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.334
They're so advanced,
you'll completely forget

00:08:56.334 --> 00:08:57.934
that your wife left you.

00:08:57.934 --> 00:09:00.334
[ Laughter ]

00:09:00.334 --> 00:09:05.167
The car company Rezvani has
announced the new $250,000 SUV

00:09:05.167 --> 00:09:06.267
called The Vengeance,

00:09:06.267 --> 00:09:07.934
which has options
for body armor,

00:09:07.934 --> 00:09:10.100
explosive protection,
and night vision.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:14.901
So come hell or high water,
your kids will get to soccer.

00:09:14.901 --> 00:09:17.300
[ Laughter ]

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:19.501
Today was National No Bra Day.

00:09:19.501 --> 00:09:21.701
So looks like Biden
hasn't undone

00:09:21.701 --> 00:09:24.200
all of Trump's
executive orders.

00:09:24.200 --> 00:09:26.501
[ Laughter ]

00:09:26.501 --> 00:09:30.934
Dunkin Donuts recently changed
its customer loyalty program

00:09:30.934 --> 00:09:33.601
from DD Perks
to Dunkin' Rewards,

00:09:33.601 --> 00:09:36.100
and I can only assume
it's because they were sued

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.601
by a 1980s porn star.

00:09:38.601 --> 00:09:42.167
[ Laughter ]

00:09:42.167 --> 00:09:44.434
Happy No Bra Day, Dee Dee.

00:09:44.434 --> 00:09:47.434
[ Laughter ]

00:09:49.601 --> 00:09:51.934
And finally, the Social Security
Administration

00:09:51.934 --> 00:09:53.868
announced today
that recipients will receive

00:09:53.868 --> 00:09:57.601
a cost of living adjustment
next year of 8.7%.

00:09:57.601 --> 00:10:02.400
So get ready for that to trickle
down to your $5 birthday checks.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.567
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

00:10:04.567 --> 00:10:09.801
♪♪

